# Default model — Grok 4.6

Grok 4.6 is the only model for this application. Use it for every parent session and every subagent. Do not switch to any other model.

- Parent / chat default: Grok 4.6
- Custom subagents in `.cursor/agents/` are pinned with `model: grok-4.6`
- When launching Task / SDLC / explore / generalPurpose / review / bugbot / security-review subagents, omit `model` or pass `inherit`
- Do not pass Claude, GPT, Gemini, Composer, Kimi, Grok 4.5, or any other model slug
- Do not re-pick a model to “use a better one” for a subtask

```
# BAD — switches the subagent off Grok 4.6
Task(subagent_type="anysys-backend-developer", model="claude-sonnet-5-thinking-high", ...)

# GOOD — stays on Grok 4.6
Task(subagent_type="anysys-backend-developer", model="inherit", ...)
# also good: omit the model argument entirely
```
